## Key Changes Made:

✅ **Added `codeHash` to data** - Tracks hash changes separately  
✅ **`generateCodeHash()` method** - Calculates hash on code updates  
✅ **Updated `code` watcher** - Updates `codeHash` when code streams  
✅ **Template displays hash** - Changed to `{{ codeHash }}` instead of direct code to avoid rendering the entire content  
✅ **Removed large code from template** - Only shows hash instead of full `effectiveCode` string

Now when the code streams, you'll see `codeHash` changing in real-time! This proves the component is reactive during streaming.
